ight: 1.4;\"><div class=\"m-auto text-base py-[18px] px-3 md:px-4 w-full md:px-5 lg:px-4 xl:px-5\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex flex-1 gap-4 text-base md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 md:max-w-3xl lg:max-w-[40rem] xl:max-w-[48rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; flex: 1 1 0%; gap: 4px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"91475fe6-1c8b-4c2d-80fd-e996eb079c24\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; gap: 2px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Creating a white-label community involves customizing the community features to match your brand. Here\u2019s a step-by-step guide:</p><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\">1. <strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Access the Subaccount in</strong></h3><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Log in to the app.</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Navigate to the sub-account where you want to create the community.</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Head over to Membership &gt; Communities</li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\">2. <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Set Up the Custom Domain (White-Labeling)</strong></h3><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">In <strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Community Settings</strong> &gt; <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Domains</strong>, add a custom domain (or subdomain) to host the community (inside a client portal). For example, <code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 1em; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">community.yourdomain.com</code>.</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Follow the instructions to update your DNS settings to point to your servers. This will make your community fully white-labeled under your domain.</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Note: The domain settings would be for Client Portal since a community exists within a client portal</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155036347756/original/r2Awd-Fj-gJQUzaJolsec9Me6B2oMMsQ5w8698.png?1731332011\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered fr-shadow inline-image\" data-id=\"155036347756\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000002887-how-to-use-the-google-sheets-premium-workflow-action-", "title": "How to use the Google Sheets Premium Workflow Action?", "folder": "Workflow", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.