"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">30444</span></span></span></p></td><td style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; width: 24.3559%;\"><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">High Risk - Fraud - Not Eligible for Resubmission</span></span></span></p></td><td style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Spam/Fraud team has flagged the number/business/traffic for spam or fraud</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><td style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; width: 11.2987%;\"><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">30444</span></span></span></p></td><td style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; width: 24.3559%;\"><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">High Risk - Deceptive Marketing - Not Eligible for Resubmission</span></span></span></p></td><td style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Campaign was assessed for deceptive marketing tactics</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><hr><h2 id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions-(FAQs)\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</strong></span></span></h2><h3 id=\"1.&nbsp;What-happens-to-my-traffic-if-my-Toll-Free-number-is-rejected?\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong>1.&nbsp;</strong></span><strong>What happens to my traffic if my Toll-Free number is rejected?</strong></span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If your Toll-Free number is rejected for one of the reasons listed in the Rejection types eligible for resubmission table above, your Toll-Free number will stay in a Pending state for up to 7 days, which allows your traffic to continue to send while you provide an amended submission with the information / changes requested. After 7 days, if your Toll-Free number submission is not amended, your traffic will move back to Restricted(Not Verified) causing your traffic to be blocked with a 30032 error and you will have to submit a new Toll-Free verification request.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If your Toll-Free number is rejected and is listed in the Rejection types ineligible for resubmission table above, your Toll-Free number will move to a Blocked state and your traffic will be blocked with a 30032 error.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"2.-My-verification-request-was-rejected,-and-is-ineligible-for-resubmission---What-can-I-do?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>2. My verification request was rejected, and is ineligible for resubmission - What can I do?</strong></span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If your Toll-Free Verification request was rejected and is ineligible, you may be able to use another LeadConnector product to reach your recipients.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The LC Email is an option for many of the above use cases. For example, cannabis- or CBD-related messaging may be conducted via email, as long as you have proper age gating in place and are sending toward recipients in a locale where the substance is legal. In addition, the Twilio Programmable Voice product is not subject to the same carrier restrictions as SMS.</span></p><h3 id=\"3.-What-happens-if-I-don't-complete-Verification?\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">3. What happens if I don't complete Verification?</strong></span></span></h3><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Starting on November 8, 2023, all unverified (Restricted) Toll-Free numbers will be blocked from sending messages to the US. Restricted Toll-free messaging traffic to Canada continues to remain blocked until verified.</span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Also, starting on January 31, 2024, all Pending Toll-Free numbers will be blocked from sending messages to the US.</span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">See the table above for messaging sending limits until then.</span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">All restricted and pending traffic filtered for these reasons will be blocked with error code 30032. Using additional Toll-Free numbers to exceed these limits or circumvent filtering isn\u2019t allowed, and will result in the same block and error code. Verification is recommended for all customers regardless of volume.</span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><h3 class=\"bold tdfocus-1665083897370\" data-identifyelement=\"612\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"4.-I-am-sending-the-limited-allowed-amount-of-segments-but-messages-are-still-not-going-through.\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">4. I am sending the limited allowed amount of segments but messages are still not going through.</strong></span></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"537\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">When using toll-free numbers, please be aware: Toll-free numbers can have messages filtered or blocked, even under the daily limit. If you see Error 30032, you might've hit a limit or a filter. The stated limits are the maximum the toll-free number can send, but not always guaranteed. For fewer issues, verify the toll-free numbers early as Verified numbers have a lower risk of message filtering.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"546\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"547\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></p><h3 class=\"bold tdfocus-1665083897370\" data-identifyelement=\"612\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"5.-Do-I-need-to-be-a-US-business-in-order-to-register-at-a-Toll-Free-number?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">5. Do I need to be a US business in order to register at a Toll-Free number?</strong></span></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"537\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px;\">No, you can use business addresses from other countries to register</span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"537\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"533\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></p><h3 class=\"bold tdfocus-1665083897370\" data-identifyelement=\"612\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"6.-Will-I-be-charged-if-I-encounter-an-error-when-sending-an-SMS?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">6. Will I be charged if I encounter an error when sending an SMS?</strong></span></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"537\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If there's an internal error with LC Phone before the message is handed off to the phone provider, you won't be charged. However, charges apply to every message where a delivery attempt has been made, regardless of the final delivery status. This includes messages sent from toll-free numbers, A2P numbers, and those not deliverable due to country restrictions or other factors. We urge users to be fully informed and cautious before sending messages, as refunds will not be provided for undelivered SMS.</span></p><hr><p><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006426-recommendations-and-best-practices-for-maintaining-a-positive-caller-reputation", "title": "Recommendations and Best Practices for Maintaining a Positive Caller Reputation", "folder": "LeadConnector Phone", "images": [], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"513\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(212, 208, 203); font-family: TwilioSansText, &quot;Inter var experimental&quot;, &quot;Inter var&quot;, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"514\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Maintaining consumer trust in the voice communication channel is critical. Consumers expect to receive wanted and personalized communications, while being protected from spam and unwanted calls. This guide provides updated best practices for maintaining a positive caller reputation.</span></p><h1 class=\"css-kstxf7\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"515\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"HEADING\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.75rem; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"516\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"517\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"518\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Why does caller reputation matter?</strong></span></span></span></h1><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"519\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"520\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"521\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Throughout the industry, there are continued and increasing efforts to reduce unwanted calls to consumers. These efforts can often lead to calls being screened or blocked. This can make it difficult for your legitimate business calls to reach customers and get answered. We have compiled a list of recommendations and best practices to maintain a positive caller reputation, minimize being blocked or flagged as spam, and improve answer rates.</span></span></span></p><h1 class=\"css-kstxf7\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"522\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"HEADING\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.75rem; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"523\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"524\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"525\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Trust Center</strong></span></span></span></h1><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"526\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"527\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"528\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">LC Phone provides Trust Center as a resource to engage with our customers to build trust within the telephony ecosystem. By registering in Trust Center, our customers are able to experience increased voice call deliverability rates and higher call answer rates. Trust Center allows customers to register their business profile, including Know Your Customer (KYC) information.</span></span></span></p><ul class=\"css-1bt452l\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"529\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"UNORDERED_LIST\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 1.5rem; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; list-style: disc; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><li class=\"css-1pp5a8v\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"530\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"LIST_ITEM\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"531\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"532\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"533\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">SHAKEN/STIR</strong>: Increase trust in your calls by displaying a trust indicator like \"Caller Verified\u201d on the called party\u2019s phone</span></span></span></li><li class=\"css-1pp5a8v\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"534\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"LIST_ITEM\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"535\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"536\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"537\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Caller ID Name (CNAM)</strong>: Display the name of your business on the called party\u2019s phone using Caller ID Name (CNAM) service</span></span></span><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li class=\"css-1pp5a8v\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"534\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"LIST_ITEM\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"535\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"536\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Please note, registering for CNAM does necessarily mean your business name will show up on your contact's phone. Your contact's carrier plan should support CNAM for the name to be displayed</span></span></span></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"538\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"539\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"540\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">For full details, see our&nbsp;<a class=\"css-oasgjm\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"541\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.7.0\" data-paste-element=\"ANCHOR\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/support/solutions/articles/48001231665-why-are-my-calls-marked-as-spam-and-how-can-i-avoid-it-lc-phone-\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; --darkreader-inline-color: #4baffd;\" target=\"_blank\">related support article</a>.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"542\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"543\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"544\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"545\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></span></span></p><h1 class=\"css-kstxf7\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"546\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"HEADING\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.75rem; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"547\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"548\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"549\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"550\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; --darkreader-inline-color: #d6d3cd;\">Telemarketing and Advertising Requirements &amp; Best Practices</span></strong></span></span></span></h1><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"551\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"552\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"553\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">If LC Phone Voice Services are used to place telemarketing or advertising voice calls, the following industry best practices and rules governing telemarketing calls must be followed to reduce the risk of disciplinary action by us, CPaaS providers, carriers, and/or third party analytic providers.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"554\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"555\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"556\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">If special circumstances justify deviation from these guidelines (such as a recruiting website with multiple positions, or a debt collector) document your practices on your website.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"557\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"558\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"559\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"560\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">1</strong>. &nbsp;<strong data-identifyelement=\"561\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Compliance with TSR, TCPA, Truth-In-Caller ID (US calls only)&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"562\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"563\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"564\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"565\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">a</strong>. Unless an exception applies, &nbsp;calls covered by the TCPA&nbsp;<strong data-identifyelement=\"566\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\" data-identifyelement=\"567\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">must have consent</span></strong> from the call recipient. &nbsp;The level of consent that the caller must obtain prior to placing a call depends on whether the call is classified as \u201cinformational\u201d or \u201ctelemarketing\u201d.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><ul class=\"css-1bt452l\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"568\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"UNORDERED_LIST\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 1.5rem; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; list-style: disc; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><li class=\"css-1pp5a8v\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"569\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"LIST_ITEM\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"570\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"571\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">For&nbsp;<strong data-identifyelement=\"572\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">telemarketing calls</strong>, callers must obtain&nbsp;<em data-identifyelement=\"573\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">prior express written consent</em>.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li><li class=\"css-1pp5a8v\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"574\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"LIST_ITEM\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"575\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"576\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">For&nbsp;<strong data-identifyelement=\"577\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">informational calls</strong>, callers are only required to obtain prior express consent.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"578\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"579\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"580\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Because the TCPA is a strict liability statute, the sender of an autodialed call can be held liable for violating the TCPA, even if the sender had a reasonable, good-faith belief that it was calling a landline.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"581\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"582\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"583\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"584\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">b</strong>.&nbsp;<strong data-identifyelement=\"585\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\" data-identifyelement=\"586\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Time Restrictions (TSR requirement).</span></strong>&nbsp; Callers cannot place calls outside the hours of&nbsp;<strong data-identifyelement=\"587\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\" data-identifyelement=\"588\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">8AM to 9PM</span></strong>, local time for the called party. Some states impose stricter requirements, including no calls on Sunday or on legal holidays and different hour restrictions. Bear in mind that the area code may not be indicative of the location of the called party (e.g, someone with a Los Angeles (213) area code may have moved to New York)</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"589\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"590\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"591\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"592\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">c</strong>.&nbsp;<strong data-identifyelement=\"593\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\" data-identifyelement=\"594\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Repeated Calls.</span></strong><strong data-identifyelement=\"595\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><em data-identifyelement=\"596\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong>Telemarketers cannot engage in fraudulent or abusive behavior, including causing any telephone to ring, or engaging any person in telephone conversation, repeatedly or continuously with intent to annoy, abuse, or harass any person at the called number. Example: \u201cLimit calls to a given number to 2 in a single day and no more than 5 in a month\u201d</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"597\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"598\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"599\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"600\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">d.&nbsp;<span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\" data-identifyelement=\"601\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Call<strong data-identifyelement=\"602\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;Conte</strong>nt.</span></strong><span data-identifyelement=\"603\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp; Additional disclosures may apply where a caller will accept a sales order or charitable contribution over the phone, or is marketing certain types of regulated products or services. &nbsp;Additionally, the TSR restricts calls with abusive or fraudulent content. &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"604\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"605\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"606\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"607\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">e.</strong><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\" data-identifyelement=\"608\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"609\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;Reassigned<strong data-identifyelement=\"610\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;N</strong>umbers Database.</strong></span> Called numbers should be checked against the Reassigned Numbers Database &nbsp;on a regular scheduled cadence (using date of consent or last verified Established Business Relationship (EBR))</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"611\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"612\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"613\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"614\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"615\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"616\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"617\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">2. Best Practices When Placing a Call</strong></span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"618\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"619\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"620\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"621\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">a.</strong> When calling a given number repeatedly, use the same caller-ID for each call.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"622\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"623\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"624\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"625\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">b.</strong> Associate a descriptive Caller ID Name (CNAM) with your caller-ID(s) (e.g. Phone Numbers). See&nbsp;<a class=\"css-oasgjm\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"626\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.7.0\" data-paste-element=\"ANCHOR\" href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/support/solutions/articles/48001231665-why-are-my-calls-marked-as-spam-and-how-can-i-avoid-it-lc-phone-#CNAM-registration%3A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; --darkreader-inline-color: #4baffd;\" target=\"_blank\">Brand Your Calls Using CNAM</a> for instructions.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"627\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"628\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"629\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"630\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">c.</strong> Announce the name of the caller at the beginning of the message. The name must be clear and unambiguous regarding its affiliation to the caller.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"631\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"632\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"633\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"634\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">d.</strong> Announce how consent was obtained.</span></span></span></p><ul class=\"css-1bt452l\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"635\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"UNORDERED_LIST\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 1.5rem; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; list-style: disc; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><li class=\"css-1pp5a8v\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"636\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"LIST_ITEM\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"637\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"638\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Example: Hi this is Gloria with AAA Insurance, Salt Lake City, Utah. Conrad Doe came to the BestInsuranceDeals.com website last week and requested that we call with an auto insurance quote. Is Conrad available?</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"639\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"640\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"641\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"642\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">e.</strong> Allow at least 30 seconds (5 ring cycles) for the called party to answer. Ensure the called party hears audio within 2 seconds of the greeting. No silent calls.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"643\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"644\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"645\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"646\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"647\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"648\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"649\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">3. Managing customer concerns when calls are answered&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"650\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"651\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"652\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"653\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">a</strong>. Address any questions or concerns raised about the nature of the call before continuing. Be prepared to offer a web URL and telephone number where the called party can turn for more information.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"654\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"655\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"656\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"657\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">b</strong>. If the called party indicates that they did not consent, or that they are no longer interested and wish to revoke consent indicate that you will not call again and remove them from your call list.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"658\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"659\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"660\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"661\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">c</strong>. If the call is answered by voicemail, do not hang up. Leave a message with the elements in (1b) above, plus a call-back number. The call back number should answer 24\u00d77 and include an opt-out mechanism.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"662\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"663\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"664\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><h1 class=\"css-kstxf7\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"665\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"HEADING\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.75rem; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"666\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"667\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"668\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Positive Caller Reputation Basic Do\u2019s and Don\u2019ts</strong></span></span></span></h1><ul class=\"css-1bt452l\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"669\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"UNORDERED_LIST\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 1.5rem; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; list-style: disc; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><li class=\"css-1pp5a8v\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"670\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"LIST_ITEM\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"671\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"672\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Comply with all \"Do Not Call\" lists (e.g.&nbsp;<a class=\"css-oasgjm\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"673\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.7.0\" data-paste-element=\"ANCHOR\" href=\"https://www.donotcall.gov/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; --darkreader-inline-color: #4baffd;\" target=\"_self\">https://www.donotcall.gov/</a> US Only), and other Telephone Consumer Protection Act (TCPA) Act 47 U.S.C. \u00a7 227 requirements (US Only).</span></span></span></li><li class=\"css-1pp5a8v\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"674\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"LIST_ITEM\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"675\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"676\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Keep your calling list(s) up to date, and remove numbers that don\u2019t connect.</span></span></span></li><li class=\"css-1pp5a8v\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"677\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"LIST_ITEM\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"678\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"679\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Unreasonable answer and completion rates are often associated with spam, so you don\u2019t want to be calling unassigned or disconnected numbers regularly, and no random \u201c<a class=\"css-oasgjm\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"680\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.7.0\" data-paste-element=\"ANCHOR\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wardialing#:~:text=Wardialing%20(or%20war%20dialing)%20is,various%20purposes%3A%20hobbyists%20for%20exploration%2C\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; --darkreader-inline-color: #4baffd;\" target=\"_self\">wardialing</a>\u201d.</span></span></span></li><li class=\"css-1pp5a8v\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"681\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"LIST_ITEM\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"682\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"683\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Provide a number and/or contact information that called parties can use to report alleged violations.</span></span></span></li><li class=\"css-1pp5a8v\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"684\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"LIST_ITEM\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"685\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"686\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Be aware and mindful of carrier practices related to intra exchange calls and legitimate code-prefixes for the destination phone number in the \u201cfrom\u201d number, aka \"neighbor\" calls. This method is often used by spam callers. Network operator call screening algorithms are aggressively monitoring for this behavior.</span></span></span></li></ul><h1 class=\"css-kstxf7\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"687\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"HEADING\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.75rem; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"688\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"689\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"690\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Be consistent in your phone number usage</strong></span></span></span></h1><ul class=\"css-1bt452l\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"691\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"UNORDERED_LIST\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 1.5rem; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; list-style: disc; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><li class=\"css-1pp5a8v\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"692\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"LIST_ITEM\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"693\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"694\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Avoid using the same telephone number for multiple purposes (i.e. marketing, surveys, and support callbacks). To help reduce the likelihood of your calls being categorized as spam, we recommend aligning the context and content of your calls over a specific phone number throughout the life of your campaign. Phone numbers that have been reassigned for other purposes should wait at least 45 days before being reintroduced in a new campaign.</span></span></span></li></ul><h1 class=\"css-kstxf7\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"695\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"HEADING\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.75rem; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"696\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"697\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"698\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Be consistent in your outbound call volume</strong></span></span></span></h1><ul class=\"css-1bt452l\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"699\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"UNORDERED_LIST\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 1.5rem; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; list-style: disc; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><li class=\"css-1pp5a8v\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"700\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"LIST_ITEM\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"701\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"702\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">If your use case allows it, attempt to maintain a regular traffic volume, without unusual spiking.</span></span></span></li><li class=\"css-1pp5a8v\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"703\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"LIST_ITEM\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"704\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"705\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Gradually ramp-up new campaign call volume incrementally over time, and avoid going from zero to full volume in a short period of time..</span></span></span></li><li class=\"css-1pp5a8v\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"706\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"LIST_ITEM\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"707\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"708\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Calls for legitimate business purposes should not be too frequent, or outside of common working hours. What is deemed too frequent varies by use case. For example, the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act notes that 8 calls to a recipient phone number within seven consecutive days is considered to be harassment and the caller can be fined. For some products/services customers can specify how many times they want to be contacted and their preferred contact channels.</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"css-tcah8o\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"709\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.6.0\" data-paste-element=\"PARAGRAPH\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(212, 208, 203); font-family: TwilioSansText, &quot;Inter var experimental&quot;, &quot;Inter var&quot;, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; --darkreader-inline-color: #cac5be;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"710\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"711\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"712\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">US ONLY:</strong> If you are following all best practices and still being labeled as spam, your best recourse will be to add your numbers to&nbsp;<a class=\"css-oasgjm\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" data-identifyelement=\"713\" data-paste-core-version=\"20.7.0\" data-paste-element=\"ANCHOR\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://freecallerregistry.com/fcr\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; --darkreader-inline-color: #4baffd;\" target=\"_self\">https://freecallerregistry.com/fcr</a> by following this&nbsp;<a data-identifyelement=\"714\" href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/en/support/solutions/articles/155000002883-remediate-spam-likely-on-your-caller-id-using-free-caller-registry\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">support article to remediate 'Spam Likely' on your Caller ID using Free Caller Registry</a>. Here, you can register your phone numbers for legitimate calls to the major US cellular providers.</span></span></span></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006698-voicemail-article-coming-soon", "title": "Voicemail article coming soon", "folder": "LeadConnector Phone", "images": [], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">Coming soon.</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "48001236824-how-to-add-change-remove-calendar-widget-logo-", "title": "How to Add/Change/Remove Calendar Widget Logo?", "folder": "Calendars", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48291041177/original/QrP9t6oFJ20uTa0BIEnhWoMFHa-V-oltyg0d4b.png?1680620919", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48291157004/original/f4KPx8Zqlu-BCfljLn9KQQ01f6KsGc5ecw9d10.gif?1680680846", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48291158038/original/wKPiwq17ScG3eLuElJXMBxm1S3WqvIk78w254e.png?1680681174", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48291158176/original/CM2ek-w-ILuNJOiPVgayyQ12BPhEcjiIHw251d.png?1680681231"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">The Calendar widget logo can be updated to represent your client's company branding. It allows more personalization and customization to be done to the Calendar Booking widget.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h4 class=\"fd-toc\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1680681477427\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Covered in this Article:</span></strong></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1680683359381\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Why-use-a-Calendar-logo,-and-who-is-this-useful-for?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Why use a Calendar logo, and who is this useful for?</span></a></span></h4><h4><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-Add-a-logo-to-your-Calendar-Booking-widget?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">How to Add a logo to your Calendar Booking widget?</span></a></span></h4><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"Why-use-a-Calendar-logo,-and-who-is-this-useful-for?\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: inherit;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1680681419966\" dir=\"ltr\">Why use a Calendar logo, and who is this useful for?</strong></span></h2><p><br></p><p>The Calendar widget logo is an important feature that can be customized to represent your client's company branding. By replacing the default logo with a custom logo that reflects your client's brand identity, the Calendar widget becomes more personalized and provides a more professional appearance to users.</p><p><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680681407064\">Customization of the Calendar Booking widget helps strengthen your client's brand identity and image. It allows your client to maintain consistency in their brand's visual appearance, making it easier for users to recognize and remember their brand.</p><p><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680681405798\" dir=\"ltr\">The logo customization feature is easy to use and can be done by uploading a high-resolution image file that meets the required specifications. Once uploaded, the custom logo will replace the default logo on the Calendar Booking widget, providing a professional and personalized appearance representing your client's brand.</p><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1680681427402\" id=\"\u200b\"><br></h2><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: inherit;\">Customizing the Calendar Booking widget logo can be useful for any business or individual who uses a calendar booking system to schedule appointments or meetings. This could include individuals such as consultants, freelancers, service providers, and businesses of any size and type, such as healthcare providers, salons, spas, law firms, or any other service-based industry. By customizing the logo, businesses can improve their branding efforts and create a more professional appearance for their clients or customers. It can also help to differentiate them from their competitors and increase brand recognition.helpful for</span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680681437863\"><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"How-to-Add-a-logo-to-your-Calendar-Booking-widget?\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: inherit;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">How to Add a logo to your Calendar Booking widget?</strong></span></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1680681249183\" dir=\"ltr\"><br>You can edit an existing Calendar or create one to add a logo. Go to Sub-Account <strong dir=\"ltr\">Settings&gt;Calendars&gt;Three dots in front of the Calendar you want to edit&gt; Edit Calendar.</strong></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680620917474\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48291041177/original/QrP9t6oFJ20uTa0BIEnhWoMFHa-V-oltyg0d4b.png?1680620919\" style=\"width: 623px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48291041177\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680620917474\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680620917474\" dir=\"ltr\"><br>In the <strong dir=\"ltr\">Team and Event Setup&nbsp;</strong>tab, scroll down to add a logo:</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680680830210\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48291157004/original/f4KPx8Zqlu-BCfljLn9KQQ01f6KsGc5ecw9d10.gif?1680680846\" style=\"width: 621px;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48291157004\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680680242088\"><br></p><p><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680680941832\" dir=\"ltr\">You can choose the logo's shape in the widget, like a&nbsp;<strong>Square or Circle</strong>. You can also select which type of widget to use this logo with. <strong>Classic or Neo</strong>.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680680941832\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680680941832\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48291158038/original/wKPiwq17ScG3eLuElJXMBxm1S3WqvIk78w254e.png?1680681174\" style=\"width: 632px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48291158038\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680680941832\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680680941832\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Please Note:</strong></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: inherit;\">The Supported dimensions of the logo are 180x180px and it should be no bigger than 2.5MB. It can only be a jpeg, gif or png file.</span></pre><p><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680681185216\" dir=\"ltr\">Once a logo has been added, you can remove&nbsp;or <strong dir=\"ltr\">Change&nbsp;</strong>it.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680681185216\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680681185216\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48291158176/original/CM2ek-w-ILuNJOiPVgayyQ12BPhEcjiIHw251d.png?1680681231\" style=\"width: 637px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48291158176\"></p><p><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "48001226590-how-to-set-up-a-dedicated-sending-domain-within-a-sub-account", "title": "LeadConnector How to Set Up a Dedicated Sending Domain Within a SubAccount", "folder": "LeadConnector Email", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48265938968/original/spw7PyvCIf6DlxRXiukwE1KRAbxsW5nK9wa053.png?1669638686", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48266011842/original/2vSwdC8UDRIvgg8Nxg03cX3oivgmKwUnjgf650.png?1669651395", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48266019581/original/ULirlt2iKm4tlyTAcqEPEbZngi4m5KFHHgb4dc.png?1669653005", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155044534677/original/AhwYYnbjZAeBkUwuL5YfHhJDs1uh97xpsQa3f0.png?1743762209", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155044883184/original/y_tZkZ81wptjB7EhY1Kc1SiyyeRQKv6wEQb510.png?1744290850", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155044883139/original/2L9UE5joSnseGJ1dYnzonDBt82Pz3oZsqwa92d.png?1744290802", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155021698396/original/XSYQYyqpEIm0mh30456h9k4v29Sno1nZvQ2982.png?1709045698", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48266012249/original/qQB-C0oyNt3QXlikSuDZ3ZxqtHbcEOojDAee69.png?1669651447", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48266012644/original/HId6bwZLXtHzQVMcReIBVLpozaZfBkBxeA389a.png?1669651502", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48266013445/original/b7skmFdUBgDZk-CxtpZf9QmzCA6QjuWwygf2da.png?1669651666", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48266012833/original/k-MlboH-Tv8bVGcsspHLBwjpB9fDq5K9xAb51c.png?1669651545"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc tdfocus-1669650509444\" data-identifyelement=\"505\" dir=\"ltr\">Email marketing is a great way to reach customers and increase sales. But if you're not careful, you could end up in trouble. A dedicated sending domain gives you control over what appears to be coming from your business. That means you can avoid spam filters and other issues that might make your messages get caught by unwanted mail servers.<br data-identifyelement=\"506\"><br data-identifyelement=\"507\">Don't let your email marketing efforts go unnoticed! Get started right away with a dedicated sending domain.</p><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1669651019095\" data-identifyelement=\"508\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"\"><br data-identifyelement=\"509\"></h4><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648193929\" data-identifyelement=\"554\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"510\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"511\">Please Note:&nbsp;</strong></span></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note tdfocus-1669648201101\" data-identifyelement=\"512\" dir=\"ltr\">Dedicated sending domains are <u class=\"tdfocus-1669648218769\" data-identifyelement=\"513\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"514\">only</strong> applicable</u> to the users in the <strong class=\"tdfocus-1669648374784\" data-identifyelement=\"515\" dir=\"ltr\"><a class=\"tdfocus-1669648401037\" data-identifyelement=\"516\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"48001225442-what-is-leadconnector-email-.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LC - Email system</a>.</strong></pre><p data-identifyelement=\"517\"><br data-identifyelement=\"518\"></p><hr data-identifyelement=\"519\"><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1669651019095\" data-identifyelement=\"520\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Covered-in-this-article:\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1669651031825\" data-identifyelement=\"521\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1669651042400\" data-identifyelement=\"522\" dir=\"ltr\">Covered in this article:</strong></span></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"523\" id=\"What-is-a-Dedicated-sending-domain?\"><a data-identifyelement=\"524\" href=\"#What-is-a-Dedicated-sending-domain?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"525\"><span data-identifyelement=\"526\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">What is a Dedicated sending domain?</span></strong></a></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"527\" id=\"How-to-create-a-dedicated-sending-domain?\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"528\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"529\"><a class=\"tdfocus-1669653699312\" data-identifyelement=\"530\" href=\"#How-to-create-a-dedicated-sending-domain?\">How to create a dedicated sending domain?</a></strong></span></h4><p data-identifyelement=\"531\"><a data-identifyelement=\"532\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-set-up-a-dedicated-sending-domain-for-Targeted-Email-Categories?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"533\">How to set up a dedicated sending domain for Targeted Email Categories?</strong></a></p><p data-identifyelement=\"534\"><a data-identifyelement=\"535\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-set-up-a-default-header-for-a-dedicated-sending-domain?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"536\">How to set up a default header for a dedicated sending domain?</strong></a></p><p><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Ability-to-turn-ON/OFF-email-tracking\"><strong>Ability to turn ON/OFF email tracking</strong></a></p><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1669653722732\" data-identifyelement=\"537\" id=\"FAQ\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"538\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"539\"><br data-identifyelement=\"540\"></strong><a class=\"tdfocus-1669653701405\" data-identifyelement=\"541\" href=\"#FAQ\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"542\">FAQ</strong></a></span></h4><ul data-identifyelement=\"543\"><li data-identifyelement=\"544\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"545\" id=\"How-to-choose-a-sending-domain-name-for-my-account?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"546\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"547\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-choose-a-sending-domain-name-for-my-account?\">How to choose a sending domain name for my account?</a><a href=\"#I've-added-a-domain-by-not-verified-at-the-time/some-of-the-records-are-not-verified,-How-to-verify?\" dir=\"ltr\" data-identifyelement=\"548\"></a></span></h4></li><li data-identifyelement=\"549\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"550\" id=\"I've-added-a-domain-by-not-verified-at-the-time/some-of-the-records-are-not-verified,-How-to-verify?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"551\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"552\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#I've-added-a-domain-by-not-verified-at-the-time/some-of-the-records-are-not-verified,-How-to-verify?\">I've added a domain by not verified at the time/some of the records are not verified, How to verify?</a></span></h4></li><li data-identifyelement=\"553\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"554\" id=\"How-to-delete-a-domain?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"555\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"556\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-delete-a-domain?\">How to delete a domain?</a></span></h4></li><li data-identifyelement=\"557\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"558\" id=\"How-to-move-sending-domain-from-Mailgun-to-LeadConnector?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"559\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"560\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-move-sending-domain-from-Mailgun-to-LeadConnector?\">How to move sending domain from Mailgun to LeadConnector?</a></span></h4></li><li data-identifyelement=\"561\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"562\" id=\"How-to-set-a-dedicated-domain-as-active/default?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"563\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"564\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-set-a-dedicated-domain-as-active/default?\">How to set a dedicated domain as active/default?</a></span></h4></li><li data-identifyelement=\"565\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"566\" id=\"How-to-set-up-a-dedicated-IP?\"><a data-identifyelement=\"567\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-set-up-a-dedicated-IP?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"568\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">How to set up a dedicated IP?</span></a></h4></li></ul><hr data-identifyelement=\"579\"><h1 class=\"tdfocus-1669648362808\" data-identifyelement=\"543\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-is-a-Dedicated-sending-domain?-2\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1669651843376\" data-identifyelement=\"580\" dir=\"ltr\">What is a Dedicated sending domain?</strong></h1><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648407684\" data-identifyelement=\"545\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"581\">A dedicated sending domain allows you to send emails that appear to be coming from your brand, and this can help you maintain a better reputation with email services. Any company can create a dedicated sending domain, and it's quick and easy.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"545\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; min-height: 15px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"582\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"546\"></span></p><div class=\"step-instructions screensteps-textblock \" data-identifyelement=\"547\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(31, 33, 41); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648248357\" data-identifyelement=\"548\" dir=\"ltr\">By default, all emails sent from our platform will show the name of our email-sending servers in the \"<strong data-identifyelement=\"583\">sent on behalf of</strong>\" or \"<strong data-identifyelement=\"584\">sent via</strong>\" email headers:<br data-identifyelement=\"585\"><br data-identifyelement=\"586\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"551\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48265938968/original/spw7PyvCIf6DlxRXiukwE1KRAbxsW5nK9wa053.png?1669638686\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1669648263064 fr-bordered\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48265938968\" data-identifyelement=\"587\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"551\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"588\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1669648280048\" data-identifyelement=\"589\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">When you set up your own custom mail server domain, you will see a different \"<strong data-identifyelement=\"590\">mailed-by</strong>\", \"<strong data-identifyelement=\"591\">sent on behalf</strong>\", or \"<strong data-identifyelement=\"592\">sent via</strong>\" field.</span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648291018\" data-identifyelement=\"552\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"593\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"553\"></span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648193929\" data-identifyelement=\"554\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"594\"><br data-identifyelement=\"595\"></p><hr data-identifyelement=\"596\"><h1 class=\"tdfocus-1669648193929\" data-identifyelement=\"554\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-create-a-dedicated-sending-domain?-3\">How to create a dedicated sending domain?</h1><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648193929\" data-identifyelement=\"554\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"597\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648193929\" data-identifyelement=\"554\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"598\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">You can create multiple sending domains under your account and make one active.</span></p></div><div class=\"step-instructions screensteps-textblock tdfocus-1669647770988\" data-identifyelement=\"512\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><p class=\"tdfocus-1669648025809\" data-identifyelement=\"528\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"599\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"529\"></span></p><ol class=\"tdfocus-1669652498763\" data-identifyelement=\"600\" style=\"list-style-type: lower-roman;\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1669652756329\" data-identifyelement=\"530\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 14px;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1669648034549\" data-identifyelement=\"601\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Navigate to <strong data-identifyelement=\"602\">Settings</strong> - &gt; &nbsp;<strong data-identifyelement=\"603\">Email settings</strong> - &gt; &nbsp;<strong data-identifyelement=\"604\">Email Services</strong></span><br data-identifyelement=\"605\"><br data-identifyelement=\"606\"><br data-identifyelement=\"607\"></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1669652774300\" data-identifyelement=\"531\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 14px;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1669648042815\" data-identifyelement=\"608\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">If you are in the LC email system, you can find the Dedicated domain button, else please switch to the LC email system to create a custom sending domain.</span><br data-identifyelement=\"609\"><br data-identifyelement=\"610\"><br data-identifyelement=\"611\"></li><li data-identifyelement=\"533\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1669652779878\" data-identifyelement=\"612\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Click the '<strong data-identifyelement=\"613\">Dedicated domain</strong>' button<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48266011842/original/2vSwdC8UDRIvgg8Nxg03cX3oivgmKwUnjgf650.png?1669651395\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1669648453434\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(31, 33, 41); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-id=\"48266011842\" data-identifyelement=\"614\"></span><br data-identifyelement=\"615\"><br data-identifyelement=\"616\"></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1669652491052\" data-identifyelement=\"533\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1669652801122\" data-identifyelement=\"617\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Add your domain details</span><br data-identifyelement=\"618\"><br data-identifyelement=\"619\"><span data-identifyelement=\"620\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"621\" dir=\"ltr\">Here are instructions for common providers:</strong></span><table data-identifyelement=\"622\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody data-identifyelement=\"623\"><tr data-identifyelement=\"624\"><td class=\"tdfocus-1669652621677\" data-identifyelement=\"625\" style=\"width: 50.0000%;\"><ul class=\"tdfocus-1669652577978\" data-identifyelement=\"626\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1669652491052\" data-identifyelement=\"533\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"627\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"550\" href=\"https://www.godaddy.com/help/manage-dns-zone-files-680\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(52, 152, 219);\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-identifyelement=\"551\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">GoDaddy</span></a><span data-identifyelement=\"553\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\"><a data-identifyelement=\"554\" href=\"https://support.google.com/a/answer/48090?hl=en\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"box-s